OL,5,
OL,6,FCollins had blamed rising cost of
OL,7,Fliving on former President Joe Biden
OL,8,Fand defended his support for Trump's
OL,9,Fwar in Iran.
OL,11,FWith polls suggesting Ossoff held a
OL,12,Fsolid lead in the race, Republicans had
OL,13,Fdiverted resources from Georgia to
OL,14,Fother contests.
